# Citation format (loaded on demand)

Rename to citation-format.md to activate.

- PDFs: cite as `(p. <n>)` or `(§<section>, p. <n>)`.
- CSVs: cite as `(row <n>, column "<name>")`.
- Long text/uploads: cite the nearest heading and a short verbatim anchor phrase.

This file is intentionally separate: it's only relevant when a task actually
needs traceable citations, so it stays out of context until then.
